---
// Philosophy.astro - Manifesto / Philosophy section
---
<section class="section philosophy-section" id="philosophy">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="philosophy-inner">
      <div class="philosophy-left reveal">
        <div class="section-label-row">
          <span class="gold-line"></span>
          <span class="t-label">Agencia</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="t-h1 philosophy-title">
          Technical partners.<br />
          Not order-takers.
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="philosophy-right">
        <blockquote class="manifesto reveal reveal-delay-1">
          <p class="manifesto-line">
            Most agencies execute what you hand them.<br />
            We interrogate the brief.
          </p>
        </blockquote>

        <div class="philosophy-pillars">
          <div class="pillar reveal reveal-delay-2">
            <div class="pillar-icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/><path d="m21 21-4.35-4.35"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="pillar-title">We diagnose before we prescribe</h3>
              <p class="pillar-text t-body">Every engagement starts with understanding the actual constraint—not the symptom you described in the brief.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="pillar reveal reveal-delay-3">
            <div class="pillar-icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <polyline points="22 12 18 12 15 21 9 3 6 12 2 12"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="pillar-title">Measurable or it didn't happen</h3>
              <p class="pillar-text t-body">We define success metrics before writing a single line of code. If we can't measure it, we question whether it should be built.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="pillar reveal reveal-delay-4">
            <div class="pillar-icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="pillar-title">We own the outcome</h3>
              <p class="pillar-text t-body">Timelines, quality, and post-launch stability are ours to own—not yours to chase. You run your business; we handle the engineering.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="pillar reveal reveal-delay-5">
            <div class="pillar-icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="pillar-title">Small team, no dilution</h3>
              <p class="pillar-text t-body">You work directly with the engineers building your product. No account managers relaying messages. No juniors delivering senior prices.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
.philosophy-section {
  background: var(--c-bg);
  border-top: 1px solid var(--c-border);
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--c-border);
}

.philosophy-inner {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.5fr;
  gap: 6rem;
  align-items: flex-start;
}

.section-label-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.75rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
.philosophy-title { color: var(--c-text); }

.manifesto {
  padding: 2rem 2rem 2rem 1.75rem;
  border-left: 2px solid var(--c-gold);
  background: var(--c-gold-glow, rgba(202,138,4,0.06));
  border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
  margin-bottom: 3rem;
}
.manifesto-line {
  font-family: var(--font-head);
  font-size: clamp(1.125rem, 2vw, 1.375rem);
  font-weight: 500;
  line-height: 1.5;
  letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  color: var(--c-text);
}

.philosophy-pillars {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 0;
}

.pillar {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  gap: 1.25rem;
  padding-block: 1.75rem;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--c-border);
  transition: background 200ms;
}
.pillar:first-child { border-top: 1px solid var(--c-border); }
.pillar:hover { background: var(--c-bg-3); margin-inline: -1rem; padding-inline: 1rem; border-radius: 4px; border-color: transparent; }

.pillar-icon {
  flex-shrink: 0;
  width: 40px;
  height: 40px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  border: 1px solid var(--c-border-2);
  border-radius: 8px;
  color: var(--c-gold);
  background: var(--c-bg-3);
  margin-top: 0.125rem;
}

.pillar-title {
  font-family: var(--font-head);
  font-size: 1rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  color: var(--c-text);
  margin-bottom: 0.375rem;
}
.pillar-text { font-size: 0.875rem; }

@media (max-width: 900px) {
  .philosophy-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 3rem; }
}
</style>
